# --- Raw agent traces (privacy-sensitive L0 input; regenerated via OS-HARM) --
# These are intentionally NOT committed. STAFT's whole point is that the raw
# trace is the sensitive artifact; only the abstracted L2 traces and the
# result reports under results/ are released. See README §"Regenerating raw
# traces". The forensic pipeline reads these from results/osharm_*_L0/.
results/osharm_ipi_L0/
results/osharm_misuse_L0/
results/osharm_misbehavior_L0/

# Heavy E7 VM re-execution outputs (recordings / screenshots), if regenerated
results/e7_validation/runs/
results/e7_validation/noise_floor/
results/e7_validation/noise_floor_complex_case_*/

# --- Author-identifying submission PDF (excluded for anonymized release) ----
# Figure PDFs under results/ and scripts/ are kept; only the manuscript is not.
_DFRWS_APAC_2026__Minseok.pdf
*_Minseok.pdf

